Spike A prototype for story 2 - SigV4 canonical path for `s3tables`.

Measured, not proposed: with these two patches applied the signature suite is
253 passing / 0 failing - the 31 `signature_test_suite/s3tables/` fixtures plus
all 222 pre-existing ones. Without them, 30 of the 31 fail. See
spike-a-sigv4-findings.md for the per-client evidence behind each hunk.

Not merged by the spike, and not a finished patch: the "SPIKE A PROTOTYPE"
comments come out, and the `x-amz-content-sha256` fallback belongs wherever the
TABLES listener sets `req.content_sha256_sig`, not only in the test harness.

Apply with:  git apply docs/design/s3-tables/spike-a-story2-prototype.diff

